## Next.js Project Setup Plan [COMPLETED]

### Problem Analysis
- Need to set up a new Next.js project with specific requirements
- Integration of multiple technologies (Prisma, SQLite, Tailwind, shadcn/ui)
- Need proper architecture documentation and project structure

### Solution Design
1. Project Setup:
   - Use create-next-app with TypeScript
   - Configure Tailwind CSS
   - Add shadcn/ui components
   - Setup Prisma with SQLite

2. Architecture Design:
   - Follow Next.js 14 App Router structure
   - Implement proper component organization
   - Setup database schema
   - Configure authentication

### Implementation Steps
- [x] Initial Next.js Setup
  - [x] Create project with create-next-app
  - [x] Configure TypeScript
  - [x] Setup Tailwind CSS
  - Success criteria: Project runs locally

- [x] Database Setup
  - [x] Install Prisma
  - [x] Initialize SQLite database
  - [x] Create initial schema
  - Success criteria: Database connects and migrations work

- [x] UI Framework Setup
  - [x] Install shadcn/ui
  - [x] Configure component system
  - [x] Setup theme
  - Success criteria: Components render correctly

- [x] Architecture Documentation
  - [x] Create architecture.md
  - [x] Document component structure
  - [x] Document data flow
  - Success criteria: Complete documentation

### Affected Components
- `/app/*` - All application files
- `/prisma/*` - Database schema and migrations
- `/components/*` - UI components
- `/docs/features/core/*` - Core feature documentation

### Dependencies
- Node.js
- Next.js 14
- Prisma
- SQLite
- Tailwind CSS
- shadcn/ui

